        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa; &quot;data&quot;: &quot;timeline\n title What each stage added to AdaDDAE baseline\n section Starting point\n DDAE baseline : Same Noise schedule for every dataset\n : Scoring by how well the model rebuilds the input\n section First custom pieces\n Stage 2 : Feature prep + adaptive Noise + smarter scoring\n : Combine several Score views together\n Stage 2.1 : Cleaner merging of experiment results\n section Smart path selection\n Stage 3 : Choose Learning settings based on dataset type\n : Better training pairs, uncertainty, Noise handling, and time-based scoring\n Stage 3.1 : Backup rules for unlabeled data and hard semi-supervised cases\n section Pushing performance higher\n Stage 4 : Separate runs for unlabeled and partly-labeled Learning settings\n Stage 4.1 : Locked reference results for fair comparison\n section Extra adaptive strategies\n Stage 5 : First try at combining models selectively\n Stage 5.1 : Extra Score views + safer result merging&quot;,&#xa; &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="Amata3F7i2w1IFPstkJ4-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
