        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa; &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n participant C as Settings\n participant E as Main experiment runner\n participant M as Flags for optional scoring tracks\n participant T as Training module\n\n C-&gt;&gt;E: Load data Learning settings and apply overrides\n E-&gt;&gt;M: Turn optional scoring tracks on or off\n Alternative Data-type-aware scoring\n M-&gt;&gt;E: Fit and apply data-type encoding\n end\n E-&gt;&gt;E: Feature prep + adaptive Noise\n E-&gt;&gt;T: Train model AdaDDAE baseline\n Alternative Selective model combination\n T-&gt;&gt;T: Fit the original baseline model\n T-&gt;&gt;T: Pick the winning Score for each sample\n end\n T-&gt;&gt;E: Average metrics&quot;,&#xa; &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="UNQlSQHL1keMbMtSJVLn-87">
